n records)** - gives ingredient amounts, processing order, heating, adjustments\n4. **专题观察 (special topic observation)** - local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories\n5. **市场观察 (market observation)** - restaurant chains, franchise, delivery promos, kitchen appliance discounts\n\nThe interest is: 家常烹饪，关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理，不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销。\n\nSo the user wants:\n- Reproducible methods (操作记录)\n- Ingredient handling (食材处理)\n- Cooking principles (烹饪原理 - 条件与原理)\n- NOT restaurant operations or kitchen appliance promos (市场观察 - exclude)\n\nWhat about 概念速览 and 专题观察?\n\n概念速览 (concept overview): lists common concepts, provides question directory for further reading. This is about cooking concepts - relevant to cooking principles/understanding. Relevant.\n\n专题观察 (special topic observation): describes local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories. This is more about food culture/history rather than reproducible cooking methods. Hmm. The interest focuses on 可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理. Food history/culture is somewhat tangential but still cooking-related. However, given the interest's emphasis on reproducible methods and principles, the 专题观察 content (food history, folk stories) is less aligned. But it's not explicitly excluded.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The interest says \"不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销\" - only explicitly excludes restaurant operations and appliance promos. So 专题观察 (food culture) is not excluded, though it's less aligned with the core focus.\n\nGiven we need 20 candidates and there are many relevant ones, I should prioritize the most aligned content:\n1. 操作记录 (reproducible methods) - most aligned\n2. 条件与原理 (cooking principles) - most aligned\n3. 概念速览 (concept overview) - aligned\n4. 专题观察 (food culture) - less aligned but not excluded\n\nLet me exclude 市场观察 entirely since it directly contradicts the interest.\n\nLet me count the non-market candidates available. Let me list all candidates and categorize.\n\nLet me go thr