, item-1f7a)\n- 炖牛肉: 1 (item-3429)\n- 番茄炒蛋: 2 (item-47ec, item-20d1)\n- 面团发酵: 2 (item-5867, item-2bd3)\n- 鸡胸肉口感: 2 (item-0ef0, item-5b3f)\n\nThat's 20. Good balance. 蒸鱼 has 3 which is acceptable given it's a common home dish.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether I should include some 概念速览 items for a more balanced collection. The task says \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\" Since all candidates are from the same source (Open Web) and same interest, content type balance matters. But the user's interest strongly emphasizes reproducible methods and principles. Including 概念速览 would add variety but they're less directly aligned.\n\nGiven the strong alignment of 操作记录 and 条件与原理 with the user's stated interest, and that I have exactly enough (28) to choose 20 from, I'll focus on these two most-aligned types. This keeps the collection tightly relevant.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The instruction says \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\" I think a mix is good but the primary driver is relevance. Since the user explicitly wants reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles, the 操作记录 and 条件与原理 types are the most relevant. I'll go with my 20 selections.\n\nLet me verify all 20 candidates are in the exposed working set and distinct. Yes, all are in the list.\n\nNow let me write specific, fact-grounded recommendation reasons for each. Each reason should explain why the content is relevant to the user (home cooking, reproducible methods, ingredient handling, cooking principles), not just repeat the title.\n\nLet me draft reasons:\n\n1. item-024e99402549 (煎饺 工作日备餐 操作记录): Provides ingredient amounts, processing order, heating intensity/time, batch comparison, and adjustment steps for overcooked/watery/undercooked dumplings - directly matches the user's interest in reproducible home cooking methods for weekday meal prep.\n\n2. item-02ec789dd9bf (清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 操作记录): Gives concrete seasoning amounts and adjustment steps for clear soup, matching the user's focus on reproducible methods and ingredient handling in home cooking.\n\n3. item-085ac75e2f6f (煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐 操作记录): Records ingredient quantities, heating control, and troubleshooting for pan-fried tofu - aligns with reproducible home cooking and ingredient handling.\n\n4. item-1635bae1e58d (米饭含水量 家庭周末午餐 操作记录): Documents water ratios and adjustment steps for rice texture, matching the user's interest in ingredient handling and reproducible results.\n\n5. item-1d12fb72a0b5 (蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 操作记录): Provides steaming amounts, timing, and correction steps for doneness/moisture - relevant to reproducible home cooking of fish.\n\n6. item-2802591dd8c9 (蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐 操作记录): Gives blanching amounts, heating control, and adjustment steps - matches ingredient handling interest for weekday prep.\n\n7. item-342993e68175 (炖牛肉 工作日备餐 操作记录): Records braising amounts, heating, and troubleshooting - reproducible home cooking method.\n\n8. item-47ec3b435037 (番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 操作记录): Provides ingredient amounts and processing order for a classic home dish, matching reproducible cooking interest.\n\n9. item-58677ff38120 (面团发酵 小份试做 操作记录): Documents fermentation amounts, timing, and adjustment steps - matches reproducible method interest.\n\n10. item-41f1925e3d74 (米饭含水量 工作日备餐 操作记录): Water ratio and adjustment steps for weekday rice - ingredient handling.\n\n11. item-0714769b6401 (煎豆腐 两人晚餐 条件与原理): Explains how moisture, temperature, and tofu structure affect texture and what changes when substituting ingredients - directly matches the user's interest in cooking principles.\n\n12. item-0ac37da79bac (蒸鱼 工作日备餐 条件与原理): Explains how moisture/temperature/structure affect steamed fish texture and substitution effects - cooking principles.\n\n13. item-0ef03b868945 (鸡胸肉口感 小份试做 条件与原理): Explains factors affecting chicken breast texture and boundaries of different treatments - cooking principles.\n\n14. item-1f7a4e5259fb (蔬菜焯水 小份试做 条件与原理): Explains how moisture/temperature/structure affect blanched vegetables - cooking principles.\n\n15. item-20168695fc11 (清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理): Explains how conditions affect clear soup seasoning and substitution effects - cooking principles.\n\n16. item-20d117d62c34 (番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 条件与原理): Explains how moisture/temperature affect tomato-egg texture - cooking principles.\n\n17. item-2bd3f1c7d71a (面团发酵 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理): Explains how moisture/temperature affect dough fermentation - cooking principles.\n\n18. item-3302498cd23d (煎饺 两人晚餐 条件与原理): Explains how moisture/temperature/structure affect pan-fried dumplings - cooking principles.\n\n19. item-34eb4892cc8d (蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理): Explains how moisture/temperature/structure affect steamed fish - cooking principles.\n\n20. item-5b3fc88bc33f (鸡胸肉口感 工作日备餐 条件与原理): Explains how moisture/temperature/structure affect chicken breast texture - cooking principles.\n\nThese are all well-grounded. Let me publish.\n\nLet me set up a plan first since this is a moderately complex task. Actually, the task is fairly straightforward - select 20 from candidates and publish. I'll create a brief plan.\n\nLet me just proceed to publish since I've done the analysis. I'll create a plan to track.\n\nActually, given the analysis is done, let me publish directly. But let me use update_plan to be thorough given complexity. I'll do a quick plan.\n\nLet me publish the recommendations.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-024e99402549","recommendationReason":"这份煎饺操作记录给出食材用量、处理次序、加热强度与时间，并针对过干、出水或不熟提供调整步骤，正符合你对可复现家常做法与食材处理的需求，且以工作日备餐为场景便于直接套用。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-02ec789dd9bf","recommendationReason":"清汤调味操作记录提供具体用量、加热记录与批次口感比较及调整步骤，契合你关注可复现做法和食材处理的家常烹饪兴趣，家庭周末午餐场景贴近日常下厨。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-085ac75e2f6f","recommendationReason":"煎豆腐操作记录涵盖食材用量、加热强度时间与过干/出水/不熟的修正方法，直接对应你对可复现做法和食材处理的核心关注，家庭周末午餐背景便于实践。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-1635bae1e58d","recommendationReason":"米饭含水量操作记录给出水量与处理次序并